      "text": "```\nHEAT IN CUTTING:\n  ~90–95% of cutting energy → HEAT (only 5–10% goes into surface work hardening)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MACHINING.md#017",
      "path": [
        "05-MACHINING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
