        "title": "Machining",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. PRIMARY SHEAR ZONE: highest heat generation — shear work in primary zone\n  2. SECONDARY ZONE (rake face/chip contact): friction + secondary shear\n  3. TERTIARY ZONE (flank/machined surface): minor rubbing"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-MACHINING.md#018",
      "path": [
        "05-MACHINING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:metalworking:05-machining, git-history:metalworking:05-machining]",
