        "title": "Machining",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Heat destination:\n    60–80%: carried away in chip → good (evacuated with chip)\n    10–20%: into workpiece → bad (causes thermal distortion, residual stress)\n    5–15%: into tool → bad (tool temperature limit → tool wear, failure)"
    },
